Package: com.guacforlife.reynarddefault
Name: ReynardDefault
Version: 1.6.1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Web links open in Reynard globally; browsers themselves stay launchable (only http(s) links are hijacked). Per-app sources configurable in Reynard's settings. Inline toggles, no preference bundle; iPadOS 15.x compatible.
Maintainer: TsangAsuna
Author: guacforlife
Section: Tweaks
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Recommends: com.opa334.ccsupport
Homepage: https://github.com/TsangAsuna/ReynardDefaultBrowser
